Package: lcos-appimage-thumbnailer
Version: 0.9.2-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 44
Maintainer: LCOS <lcos@lunduke.com>
Homepage: https://lunduke.com
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-pyelftools, gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, squashfs-tools, tumbler
Description: AppImage icon thumbnails for Thunar and XFCE desktop
 Freedesktop thumbnailer that extracts .DirIcon from Type-2 (SquashFS)
 AppImages for tumbler. Shows per-AppImage icons in Thunar and on the
 XFCE desktop. Does not add AppImages to application menus.
